      "content": "thanks for that. it's a good start, but i just ran it through our internal checker and the simplicity score is actually pretty low (around 0.65). for our elderly demographic, we really need that score to be much higher, ideally above 0.85, so they don't get stuck on big words.\n\ncan you try a second draft? i really need you to aim for that higher score, but i'm still stressing: please don't sacrifice the medical details or make it sound like a children's book. it still needs to feel professional and accurate. just try to swap out the more complex terms for simpler ones if you can.",
